ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Qué petición quieres que firme?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿"{{TAG:0012:0001:}}"?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Pero si ni siquiera estoy de acuerdo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¡Menuda idea!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Lo siento,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} tendrás
que buscarte a otro.

IT:
Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Dici che dovrei firmare per
"{{TAG:0012:0001:}}"?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, ho capito!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Sì, dai!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti faccio un bell'autografone!

TRANSLATION:
Hı?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0012:0001:}} için bir çeşit dilekçeye
yardım etmemi mi istiyorsun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Anladım!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Güzelmiş!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Memnuniyetle imzalarım!

IT:
Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Vuoi che firmi per la petizione
"{{TAG:0012:0001:}}"?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}sicuro!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ma guarda che la mia calligrafia è
peggio di quella di un dottore.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ti sfido a decifrarla.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!

ES:
¿Te vale así?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vaya viaje te has pegado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
viniendo desde {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0006:}}
solo para recoger firmas.
Sigue así,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡pero aprovecha
y haz más cosas!

DE:
So, das wär's!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ganz schöner Aufwand, dafür den
ganzen weiten Weg von {{TAG:0005:0006:}}
herzukommen!

EN:
Here you go!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}So {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}you came all the way out here
to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} just to collect those
signatures?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ahh, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}maybe you're doing it while
you take care of other things, huh?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Either way, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}good luck with that!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

ES:
¡Listo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¿Y has venido a {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
a recoger firmas?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pues ya que estás aquí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} aprovecha
y degusta los productos de la tierra.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Y suerte con la petición!

IT:
Ecco qua!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}E allora, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ti sei fatt{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} tutta questa
strada fino {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} solo per
raccogliere qualche firma?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ahhh, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}forse sei qui anche per
sbrigare altre faccende?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Vabbè, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}buona fortuna!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

TRANSLATION:
Al bakalım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Demek {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} buraya {{TAG:0005:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
kasabasına kadar sırf imza toplamak
için geldin?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aa, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}belki başka işlerini de aradan
çıkarıyorsundur, ha?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Neyse, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}bol şans!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

ES:
Hala,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡firmado!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Espero que el viaje
te esté mereciendo la pena.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Suerte con las demás firmas!

FR:
Voilà, c'est signé.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}T'en as fait, du
chemin, pour ma signature !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Continue comme ça !

DE:
So, hier ist meine Unterschrift!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Bestimmt stressig, dafür in eine
andere Stadt zu fahren!

ES:
¡Garabato y se acabó!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Tienes la hoja de firmas completa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
He sido imprescindible,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} como de
costumbre.

EN:
Here you go!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}And my signature was
the very last one you needed!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Now you can submit this, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Very nice!

Here you go!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It looks like the sheet is all filled up!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Good work!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Now you can submit
this petition, huh?

IT:
Ecco qua la mia firma!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, ma il modulo è completo!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Grande!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ora puoi consegnare
